@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classFontSize 13
title CARD 1 - Class diagram relationships: which line, which end

class A1 as "Case"
class B1 as "EvidenceItem"
A1 *-- B1 : composition\nFILLED diamond at the WHOLE\nparts die with the whole

class A2 as "Team"
class B2 as "Member"
A2 o-- B2 : aggregation\nHOLLOW diamond at the WHOLE\nparts survive the whole

class A3 as "Investigator"
class B3 as "CustodyLog"
A3 -- B3 : association\nplain line\nthey simply know each other

class A4 as "Investigator"
class B4 as "Administrator"
B4 --|> A4 : generalization\nHOLLOW TRIANGLE at the PARENT\nchild points UP to parent

class A5 as "RiskScorer"
class B5 as "EvidenceItem"
A5 ..> B5 : dependency\nDASHED arrow\nuses it, does not hold it

note bottom
  MULTIPLICITY goes at BOTH ends:  1    0..*    1..*    0..1
  VISIBILITY before the name:  + public   - private   # protected
  The DIAMOND always sits at the WHOLE end, never at the part.
end note
@enduml
